Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:00.27,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Intro}
Comment: 0,0:02:00.27,0:10:22.94,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Comment: 0,0:10:22.94,0:26:07.88,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Comment: 0,0:26:07.88,0:27:40.43,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:09.95,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,If the heroes who saved the world could \Nfind peace, their missions would be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:15.58,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,However, those heroes were denounced and\N set to be killed by the people they once saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:21.38,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,People who said they had no more use for titans with extreme power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.05,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,But that was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:35.91,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Heroes who had achieved legendary deeds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:40.25,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,shouldn't have had to die such brutal deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:43.79,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,If they were to be killed \Nwhen they were still heroes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.79,0:01:45.71,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,then they ought to \Nreturn to being regular citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:49.59,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Helping heroes become normal citizens:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:55.22,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,that was the job of the Hero Retirement and\N Return to Everyday Life Assistance Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Twin heroes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters, who were \Ndispatched as heroes together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,worked together, and returned together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? That's quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The older sister's name is Tsuranari Hakua.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The younger sister is Kougyoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.87,0:02:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Which will I be taking care of?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The older sister? The younger sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Both?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this is such a rare case, we decided to\N have them transition to normal life together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving you, Uro, this dangerous job,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.18,0:02:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,was a unanimous decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the higher-ups think it's okay \Nto just give me any job they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't refuse or \Ntalk your way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd at least like an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.57,0:02:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you two will be living here \Non Earth as regular citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:02:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"Do you have any questions", he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,First you ought to bow down, peasant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rude of you to speak \Non the same eye level as I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've said this over and over. You are no longer a hero, but an ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on out, you'll study and work like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling a lady knight \N"ordinary" is most irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I am ordinary, then what \Ndo you suppose you are? A worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rubbish, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.81,0:03:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not change!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Defiant, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.11,0:03:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, kids like you \Nadapt quickly to everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh. Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That I would mingle with \Ncommoners is unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is is not, sister of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrounded with the sword,\N armor, and ornaments I made,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,my sister will forever stand as a hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of that I am sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, today work was tiring! \NI worked {\i1}soooo{\i0} hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Uro, make dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently you've been doing full shifts every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to build up experience \Nquickly so I can level up my skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep being a bother to the shop manager forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How admirable of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And with me there, the atmosphere of the shop has improved, so I can rise quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And there is something I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be able to get it \Nif I save up just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't work yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just an ordinary person now—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm tired of hearing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time. They say it's good to keep a goal in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sister of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to hear my talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your pride as a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting so upset about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:05:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not as though I can avoid\N rubbing shoulders with the masses,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean\N I have given up my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,On the way home from work at the café, \NI got a little cake so cutesy you'd squeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand... what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with that ordinary outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the silver armor I gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, I'd feel out of place wearing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try being fashionable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons of cute clothing in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku, you should join us next time we—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the sword? \NThe sword I gave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The earth has this legal system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll arrest you if you\N have a blade over 6 cm long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A law?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And gems?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the ruby in which I instilled divine protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wore that it would get stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get shot, so don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyway, there's no \Nsuch thing as demons in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't need divine protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my sister anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kougyoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off that eyepatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can actually see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably dangerous to \Nnot have depth perception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with that attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uro, hurry up and make dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And the floor's sopping wet! Wipe that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to eat dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like ginger roast?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you making a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's what you've \Nbeen doing your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The days keep coming, and you keep working in your studio,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,making weapons and \Narmor and protective ornaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All for Hakua.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wasn't it hard for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That no matter how much work you put into the weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the only one who received the honor and praise was the hero Hakua?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you're the \None who gave Hakua her power,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,no one paid any attention to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep giving, but you can't get anything in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the fate of a supporting character.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When the crowds speak of Hakua,\N my swords and armor are included.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need any reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:08:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly why it's so hard \Nfor me to forgive Hakua for changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tossing away the things\N I've made so carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,for some "part-time job", for some "fashion"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you changing my Hakua?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamada Uro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you made Hakua into a hero,\N I'll make you two into regular citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't change!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.19,0:08:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of that I am sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll show you, \Nand make Hakua a hero again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that sword's all bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's proof you're not looking at what's in front of your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't make a weapon that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike the world you want to be in, \Nyou can't easily use magic here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to become a craftsperson in this world, it'd be best to start from scratch—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If I use it that way, it's a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuranari Kougyoku. Former craftsperson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Item-maker who used all of her\N power for her older sister, a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like she's still trapped in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And that dream is probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking so gloomy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't forgive the world that takes\N the sister that she gave her all to,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and turns her into something mediocre, isn't she just the model younger sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh, how innocent...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Having dreams is an admirable thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd like if she'd stop having her dreams depend on another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's entrusting her \Nentire worth as a person to her sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we should try to arrange a little get-together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get-together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Assemble Alice and the heroes you've worked with so far at the beach,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and let Kougyoku-chan meet \Nsomeone other than Hakua-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me to be there to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty good idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're not just asking because \Nyou want to see girls in swimsuits, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to confirm or deny my motivations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\t(2500,4440,\c&H110E0E&\3c&H040910&)}Don't try and hide your fetishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll relax on the beach in the afternoon, and have barbecue for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, with full stomachs,\N we'll have fun with fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good chance for you to get to know each other better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakua, Kyogyoku, say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I thought this was a pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but as long as I'm here I plan to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you too, say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I bet it'll be a lot of fun!\N I can't wait to eat some barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Karon-san's as energetic as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But to be sure, this is a great chance for us to\N meet new people and strengthen our relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think? Airo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to say one way or the other, this feels like a bother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Little one, remember to \Nplay nice with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when have you been my mother, Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\t(4000,5420,\c&H110E0E&\3c&H040910&)}Oh my. You don’t have to call me your mother, "young lady" will do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Killer technique,\N Ultra No-Way-In-Hell Super Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With an exceedingly lame attack name like that, there's no way you could defeat me, Karon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Miracle Hyper Jump-Powered Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I couldn't stop it at this range...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Working part-time all night might be hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I haven't felt this kind of indignity since I was a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How irritating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Working part-time all night sure is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're tired, \Nyou can't summon any strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,However. That physical \Nlimitation is a good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Striving to reach new heights,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,dealing with a body that refuses to do as it's told...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, your will may be broken harder than your body in the end, but even so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Buckling down and refusing to give in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,creates its own kind of \Nlight at the end of the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Things aren't going to go as you expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's because you can't reach\N those heights that life is interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At first glance, you seemed dim-witted,\N and your speech appeared foolishly blunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but you say can some rather deep things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind if you start looking up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be impertinent \Nand arrogant, but I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we're friends, why don't we run off into the sunset together?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's midday as hell right now, but I concur!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they learn that kind of meat-headed communication?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, just looking at them is sweltering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, isn't it a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blending bodies and heat, \Ntheir hearts move as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of communication is lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I-If you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Of course, I also love the quiet bonding we are sharing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many ways of \Ninteracting with other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, there are so\N many people in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Reca-san, you have such a big heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As one would expect of a former princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There are times where I can't quite say the same about myself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's not good, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are the decorations all Rococo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't we decide on a Gothic style?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's because I like swirly things!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Airo-san, you're too picky about your scenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh—what's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This kind of thing works out best when you stick to the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, if you get that upset about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just as bad as Karon-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell Uro-kun about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful former heroes\N in swimsuits! And the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What a peaceful scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:14:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Apart from you being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't fit in with them, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl... she reminds me a lot of how you were long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to Uro-san, \NKougyoku-chan is way, way cuter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Four-eyes, you're getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You want things that are important to you to remain important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you can't accept new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You become obstinate and close in on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say she's like me, but you shouldn't treat her that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tease her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It does make me want to... stir things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything tastes better \Nwhen you eat outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uro, more alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're drinking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku-san!\NPerfectly-done meat, just for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I've been aiming to talk to you since this afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I became too caught\N up frolicking with Hakua-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku-san, let's be friends too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, rejected! I just got hit with a clear, outright rejection!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, it was your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, heroes sure have such bad manners, it's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.32,Default alt,,0,0,0,,Woah, from the witch too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let this loud one be,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and let's relax and talk over there, just us two support characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pain too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, Kougyoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it already! You've \Ngot to try to communicate or—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "friends"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "communication"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you get along with them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a hero, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you been so \Nunhappy about this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going out of their way to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! It's because of that that you're—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what\N my younger sister is thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to check on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:46.21,Default alt,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:48.46,Default alt,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, where could she have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alice went after her, so I'm sure it's nothing too extreme, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is something to \Nbe worried about, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:18:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bound to be up to something,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that old monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She does tend to play \Nsome nasty tricks sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She's overloaded with cuteness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:10.40,Default alt,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Uro-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Kougyoku-san won't be too mad at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Airo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of understand her feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As support characters, no matter how hard we try, we can't get the glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we get so\N picky about certain things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's really important to her is probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. She won't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Hakua understands that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But where could Kougyoku-san be—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:18:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What could she possibly be \Ntalking about, that sister of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All my plans have gone down the drain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:16.34,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Hakua!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.68,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I finished a new gem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:20.35,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,It's full of protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:23.14,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,As long as you have this, you're invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, she's so troublesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We still can't find her...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And where did that meat-head go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And four-eyes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If Karon-san's gone too, then that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it is Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Airo-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Reca! Stay close to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Alice! Kougyoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"We have the heroes. If you want them back, come to the beach!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamada Uro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Send Hakua and me back to our world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alice. What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just helping out a woman\N with something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to test you, anytime, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose I could get you to \Nstop putting my life on Hard Mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Send us back immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kougyoku. You made that \Ncrossbow by yourself, didn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't shoot with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not held together well, and it's crooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but as long as \Nyou can't accept this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.01,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't craft anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What right do you have to say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Crafting things in this \Nworld is a very difficult thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're not looking\N properly at the things in front of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't make anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you get in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just love the hero Hakua,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to make things for her
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,so she can be praised,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and free, and strong... that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}Become the greatest craftsperson in this world, \Ntoo! This time, without any magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kougyoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakua...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was planning for a situation \Nwhere you were more excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.07,0:22:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's not a big deal anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. It's a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakua's been working so hard at her part-time job to buy this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Day in and day out, living a life she couldn't get used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can do anything if I put my mind to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,why would you do something like that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.22,0:22:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a supporting character.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my job to give you—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you being so\N picky about? Sister of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I received so much from \Nyou back in the other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.77,0:22:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it's my turn to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.77,0:22:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Earn money through dealing with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,800)}I'll take on the daily tasks of a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you can put your whole \Nheart into mastering craftsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means you—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.54,0:23:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In the other world \NI was one of the greatest hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And in this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your only sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you ought to be a little fashionable too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like me, you can't \Nlet your beauty go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:23:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sparkler!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.85,0:24:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wait your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's just like you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.77,0:24:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep saying that, but in what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever she decides something's important, she won't let go no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.74,0:24:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, very stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.57,0:24:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, when you put it that way, I kind of—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.32,0:24:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Karon! Don't wave the\N sparkler around! That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.37,0:24:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody let me down...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.29,0:24:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With that matter settled, it's so much fun to fireworks with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.42,0:24:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You were easily captured \Npretty early on, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.05,0:24:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are the kind of witch that little kids worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.72,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's light up one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.72,0:24:53.72,Default alt,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.10,0:24:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I lost again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.73,0:24:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, seven wins in a row!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.77,0:25:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.94,0:25:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose the next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.65,0:25:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win the next one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.98,0:25:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll make eight points!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.32,0:25:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think there are \Nbeautiful things in this world, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.67,0:26:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
